  "content": "<p data-pid=\"1YLjdaHz\">看懂一篇日语小说的难度其实没有那么高，直接上 Jiten 查一下最简单的轻小说：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1816\" data-rawheight=\"636\" data-original-token=\"v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1816\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1816&#39; height=&#39;636&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1816\" data-rawheight=\"636\" data-original-token=\"v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1816\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1852\" data-rawheight=\"1604\" data-original-token=\"v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1852\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1852&#39; height=&#39;1604&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1852\" data-rawheight=\"1604\" data-original-token=\"v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1852\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"NIiq-4kS\">去重后共 2644 个词，掌握 1082 个就覆盖了 90% 内容。</p><p data-pid=\"4GpV7WNy\">但是如果你按 JLPT 考级的词汇表去背，你全背下来，也不一定能覆盖这一千个词，因为轻小说的一些用词，JLPT 根本不考。</p><p data-pid=\"IqGdspS4\">我大概是自学日语半年后开始看轻小说的，那个时候我的词汇量大约在 3000～4000 左右。</p><p data-pid=\"qGCZ3j_w\">我看的第一本轻小说是週に一度クラスメイトを買う話　～ふたりの時間、言い訳の五千円～，断断续续读了一个多月，十几个小时才读完，查了一千多个生词。阅读速度估计只有 6000 字符/小时 出头。</p><p data-pid=\"R4uK7kqA\">不过这个只是暂时的，多读几本难度相当的作品后，速度会越来越快：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2800\" data-rawheight=\"1404\" data-original-token=\"v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2800\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2800&#39; height=&#39;1404&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2800\" data-rawheight=\"1404\" data-original-token=\"v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2800\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"sVu57YIQ\">我目前读得最快的一本是週クラ的第7卷。非常推荐初学者读週クラ来提升日语阅读水平。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1512\" data-rawheight=\"1546\" data-original-token=\"v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1512\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1512&#39; height=&#39;1546&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1512\" data-rawheight=\"1546\" data-original-token=\"v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1512\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Q19sOmTg\">说完轻松的，再说难的。入间人间的新书难度有点超纲了，和奇诺之旅一个水平：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"561\" data-original-token=\"v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1280&#39; height=&#39;561&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"561\" data-original-token=\"v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"561\" data-original-token=\"v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1280&#39; height=&#39;561&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"561\" data-original-token=\"v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"I-u2CfYb\">动不动就是词频六七万名开外的词，恐怖如斯（bushi</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1578\" data-rawheight=\"956\" data-original-token=\"v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1578\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1578&#39; height=&#39;956&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1578\" data-rawheight=\"956\" data-original-token=\"v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1578\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ATqmj9oK\">不过这种词一般都是汉字词，除了有些不太会念，理解上倒是比较简单了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2162\" data-rawheight=\"2028\" data-original-token=\"v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2162\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2162&#39; height=&#39;2028&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2162\" data-rawheight=\"2028\" data-original-token=\"v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2162\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"rFX4IwGH\">这种词你 N1 词汇背穿了也不会，只能多读小说积累。毕竟 N5～N1 所有词汇加起来，也就一万多。一般日语母语者词汇量都五六万，还远着呢。</p><h2>推荐阅读</h2><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2077813393189253839\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"最佳阅读沉浸——窄式阅读\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cc6d1215501255e3b718e72c3e550562.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">最佳阅读沉浸——窄式阅读</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1919168095198638425/answer/2054997204230842302\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2528a7887565a7ec91a1f9b80ea8803f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1997820217334720129/answer/2052731244878763625\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"有什么免费的日语学习软件？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-0f902ae3095f87532923b055369de227.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">有什么免费的日语学习软件？</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/20544217/answer/2050918040452216003\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"对于日语初学者有什么值得看的日语读物？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cbd397721914f2d7866215b936db6ff1.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">对于日语初学者有什么值得看的日语读物？</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/90446\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"Yokubi 中文版\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-554985ceb6b4b36f5b48d1df021e600b.jpg?needBackground=1&amp;source=edda2ec7\" class=\"internal\">Yokubi 中文版</a><p></p>",
